                                "sense_id": "9baeff33-5a48-37df-b069-91b0b08028d7",
                                "text": "Влюбчивый в детстве, ненасытно сладострастный в юности и в зрелых годах, развратный в старости — Карл II постепенно превращался из эпикурейца в циника, подавая пример крайней разнузданности нравов всему двору."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "70aa4453-1d7d-45bc-807a-a99a5b6c2277",
                                "sense_id": "9baeff33-5a48-37df-b069-91b0b08028d7",
                                "text": "— Он застенчив и влюбчив и уж, конечно, влюблён в вас?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d0582ca-6b58-4b16-9c96-a634cb9a6dd4",
                        "source_entry_id": "c73f3672-deb3-314a-91fa-f1e598b20149",
                        "source_sense_id": "9baeff33-5a48-37df-b069-91b0b08028d7",
                        "target_lang_word": "amorous",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "amorous",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46bb435d-9ca5-3d7a-ab32-2207a2e08c26",
                                        "entry_id": "381f2e34-c0f6-35e8-a4fd-bb5561970ce6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inclined or having a propensity to love, or to sexual enjoyment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d838d025-8e0a-4864-8aee-e8115a7d264e",
                                                "sense_id": "46bb435d-9ca5-3d7a-ab32-2207a2e08c26",
                                                "text": "an amorous disposition"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c651201b-e79b-4cb0-b591-6fc46a15b28a",
                                                "sense_id": "46bb435d-9ca5-3d7a-ab32-2207a2e08c26",
                                                "text": "We were both feeling amorous so the inevitable happened."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be2ac5ef-14f2-48fa-977e-62671da79c6d",
                                                "sense_id": "46bb435d-9ca5-3d7a-ab32-2207a2e08c26",
                                                "text": "Breezes blowing from beds of iris quickened her breath with their perfume; she saw the tufted lilacs sway in the wind, and the streamers of mauve-tinted wistaria swinging, all a-glisten with golden bees; she saw a crimson cardinal winging through the foliage, and amorous tanagers flashing like scarlet flames athwart the pines."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a94959d-f6ba-395c-9779-aa3a7358750a",
                                        "entry_id": "381f2e34-c0f6-35e8-a4fd-bb5561970ce6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Indicating love or sexual desire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fddbf370-2616-4855-a71c-e95dbaee108b",
                                                "sense_id": "7a94959d-f6ba-395c-9779-aa3a7358750a",
                                                "text": "She kept making these amorous suggestions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8d06bc3-46c0-41c1-8b27-551fbcea7f7e",
                                                "sense_id": "7a94959d-f6ba-395c-9779-aa3a7358750a",
                                                "text": "UUho when he ſhal embrace you in his arms\nUUil tell how many thouſand men he ſlew.\nAnd when you looke for amorous diſcourſe,\nWill rattle foorth his facts of war and blood: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1413117-c9ff-4c38-8b11-2c77f475329c",
                                                "sense_id": "7a94959d-f6ba-395c-9779-aa3a7358750a",
                                                "text": "Long were to tell the amorous aſſayes,\n And gentle pangues, with which he maked meeke\n The mightie Mars, to learne his wanton playes:"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28742b01-5310-4f87-a527-7e236fc46886",
                                                "sense_id": "7a94959d-f6ba-395c-9779-aa3a7358750a",
                                                "text": "There was no tune to it, only amorous gruntings like those of some old satyr who had furnished music for Circe's revels."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ec3a90a-b5e8-4111-94bb-b794358c1370",
                                                "sense_id": "7a94959d-f6ba-395c-9779-aa3a7358750a",
                                                "text": "When held in the hand, the lizard produces an amorous stimulus."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a35469e2-6793-3775-948f-8cbc9ec05699",
                                        "entry_id": "381f2e34-c0f6-35e8-a4fd-bb5561970ce6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to, or produced by, love."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ece3394a-d7fa-43ea-b14b-c121faf5bfb6",
                                                "sense_id": "a35469e2-6793-3775-948f-8cbc9ec05699",
                                                "text": "She read me an amorous poem."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3cdba0d2-1335-35e7-9171-793eeb7ebaa3",
                                        "entry_id": "381f2e34-c0f6-35e8-a4fd-bb5561970ce6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Affected with love; in love; enamored."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "985a8d4d-ea89-41fe-94c5-003a31eb5596",
                                                "sense_id": "3cdba0d2-1335-35e7-9171-793eeb7ebaa3",
                                                "text": "He had been amorous of her since schooldays."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "33e7b4b7-dfaf-4709-8b42-0094fedb9429",
                        "source_entry_id": "c73f3672-deb3-314a-91fa-f1e598b20149",
